cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use this software, please cite it as below."
title: "GeoDynamix (beta)"
type: software
authors:
  - given-names: "Abraham Joseph"
    family-names: "Okayli Masaryk"
    email: "ajokaylimasaryk@uh.edu"
    affiliation: "University of Houston"
version: "0.1.0-beta"
date-released: "2026-09-22"
license: GPL-2.0-or-later
abstract: >-
  An instrument for interrogating structure across scales in rasters of any provenance
  (bathymetry, DEMs, satellite imagery, EBSD maps): wavelet-transform modulus-maxima (WTMM)
  and microcanonical multifractal analysis, multiscale edge detection and diffusion filters,
  run on saved regions of interest of arbitrarily large rasters.
keywords:
  - wavelets
  - WTMM
  - multifractal analysis
  - edge detection
  - structural geology
  - bathymetry
